<title>USA: Cleveland Cty ISD 29, Okla., won by Bank of Okla..</title>
<headline>Cleveland Cty ISD 29, Okla., won by Bank of Okla..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Oklahoma, NA said it won $2.400 million of Cleveland County Independent School District No 29 (Norman), Okla., building and equipment bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.6486 percent.</p>
</text>
